  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIFTAHOU Moringa &amp; Maize Processing Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moringa and Maize, a group of 43 women. 301 indirect beneficiaries (157 women). Moringa processing into powder, soap, oil, and pomade as well as corn processing into farine powder and oil. Purchase of a oil press and seed capital along with a construction of a processing facility to increase member sales and income.</narrative>
